        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute the deviatoric stress field for the momentum equation: tau_ij = (nu + nut) * (dev2(gradU^T))_ij = (nu + nut) * (gradU_{ji} - (2/3)*tr(gradU)*delta_ij) </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Matches OpenFOAM&apos;s: nuEff * dev2(T(gradU)) Returns VolumeField&lt;Tensor&gt; (non-symmetric in general). Used by divDevReff for the momentum viscous term. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
